  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Aqua Morada stands as a vibrant celebration of love, passion, and deep connection to water inspired by Puerto Rico's enchanting beaches.</span>&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Handcrafted in Brazil, our Versatile, reversible and multi-style designs swimwear are created to effortlessly transitions from beachside lounging to urban exploration, allowing you to express your individuality wherever you go. Our chic pieces feature versatile designs, captivating prints, and flattering cuts, delivering sophistication infused with glamour.</span>&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Our exclusive collections are expertly designed to be versatile, reversible and provide multi-style functionality. They are crafted from premium eco-friendly fabrics ensuring durability and sustainability. Made with soft, stretchy, breathable, and lightweight materials, they provide unmatched comfort and a flawless fit. Our eco-friendly fabrics feature UPF 80+ Stretch &amp; Wet protection, shielding you from the sun's harmful rays even when stretched and wet.</span>&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Net30 &ndash; 8% Commissioning Rate</span>&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
